  "description": "Kim Jin, once traumatised by a past experience, has been avoiding games for years. By a twist of fate, he meets Jung Jin Ah during orientation and unexpectedly joins a club. Little does he know, this club pushes its members to their absolute limits through intense and competitive gameplay! This is the story of six fiercely driven club members as they navigate the thrilling world of high-stakes challenges and friendship.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=771018), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6126325)",
